---
id: org.dxos.example.inbox-sync
name: InboxSync
version: 0.1.0
---

A synthetic spec modelled on `packages/plugins/plugin-inbox`: how mail reaches the inbox, revised
several times as the team learned what the provider allows. Most decisions replace an earlier one.
Story fixture for `ChangelogGraph`; not a real spec.

## Extensions

| Term       | URI                         |
| ---------- | --------------------------- |
| `feat`     | `org.dxos.mdl.feat@1.0`     |
| `decision` | `org.dxos.mdl.decision@1.0` |

## Features

```mdl
feat F-1: Sync
  req F-1.1: New mail arrives by push from the provider's watch API.
  req F-1.2: A full sync runs once a day to repair anything push missed.
  req F-1.3: A failed sync retries with exponential backoff, capped at one hour.
```

## Changelog

```mdl
decision D-1: The inbox polls the provider every five minutes.
  date: 2026-08-01
  by: user:dana
  affects: [F-1.1]
```

```mdl
decision D-2: A failed poll retries after one minute. Fills in [D-1].
  date: 2026-08-01
  by: agent:claude-code
  for: user:dana
  affects: [F-1.3]
```

```mdl
decision D-3: The inbox polls every minute.
  date: 2026-08-10
  by: user:dana
  affects: [F-1.1]
  supersedes: D-1
```

```mdl
decision D-4: A failed poll retries with exponential backoff, capped at one hour. Fills in [D-3].
  date: 2026-08-10
  by: agent:claude-code
  for: user:dana
  affects: [F-1.3]
  why: One-minute polls with one-minute retries hit the provider's rate limit during an outage.
  supersedes: D-2
```

```mdl
decision D-5: New mail arrives by push from the provider's watch API.
  date: 2026-08-20
  by: user:erin
  affects: [F-1.1]
  supersedes: D-3
```

```mdl
decision D-6: The watch is renewed every six days, one day before the provider expires it. Fills in [D-5].
  date: 2026-08-20
  by: agent:claude-code
  for: user:erin
  affects: [F-1.1]
```

```mdl
decision D-7: Approve [D-4] and [D-6].
  date: 2026-08-21
  by: user:erin
```

```mdl
decision D-8: A full sync runs every hour to repair anything push missed. Fills in [D-5].
  date: 2026-08-22
  by: agent:claude-code
  for: user:erin
  affects: [F-1.2]
```

```mdl
decision D-9: The repair sync runs once a day, not hourly.
  date: 2026-08-25
  by: user:erin
  affects: [F-1.2]
  supersedes: D-8
```
